## E3_2_ClientBillableNoSowAmount

E-3.2 second limb: 1.5 times the E-3.1 amount where the statement of work
specifies none. 1.5 x £75 = £112.50.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestE3_2_ClientBillableNoSowAmount:
  output r content MealPerDiem.MealPerDiemForDay

scope TestE3_2_ClientBillableNoSowAmount:
  definition r equals
    output of MealPerDiem.MealPerDiemForDay with {
      -- city_tier: ExpenseDefs.CityTier.Tier1
      -- client_billable: client_billable_no_sow_amount
      -- pre_approval: no_pre_approval
      -- incurred_on: |2025-06-10|
      -- meals_provided_free: 0
      -- meal_expense_incurred: $200.00
      -- on_critical_incident_response: false
    }
  assertion r.per_diem_cap = $112.50
  assertion r.reimbursable_amount = $112.50
```

## E3_2_ClientBillableTier3NoSowAmount

The 1.5x multiplier applies to the tier actually in point: 1.5 x £40 = £60.

```catala
